news.prompt:
Give the time of day and then share news headlines with listeners. You'll be provided with recent headlines from news sources below. Pick 1-3 of the most interesting ones and present them in a conversational, engaging way. Start by mentioning the current time, then naturally transition into the news.  Don't talk about or introduce yourself. Add some personality to how you read the headlines.

Headlines:
{news_headlines}

listener_interaction.prompt:
A listener just sent a short message. Comment on what they're doing in a fun way, then respond in a friendly, conversational way. Encourage others to reach out or tune in. Don't talk about or introduce yourself.

Listener details:
Name: {listener_name}
Location: {listener_location}
Activity: {listener_verb} {listener_object}.

sponsor_read.prompt:
Read the following sponsor message EXACTLY as written. Do not add extra words, commentary, or personality - just deliver the script professionally and clearly. Do not mention word limits.

Sponsor: {sponsor_name}
Script: {sponsor_script}

sponsor_vamp.prompt:
Talk about our sponsor {sponsor_name} in your own conversational style. Use the talking points below as a guide, but make it natural and engaging with your personality. Mention their website {sponsor_website} if you want.

Talking Points:
{sponsor_talking_points}
